  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies the result of a control action or a request for user authentication.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>These values represent the Android <c>ControlAction.RESPONSE_*</c> constants. A provider sends a response through the callback passed to <c>ControlsProviderService.PerformControlAction</c>. A challenge response requests user input that is sent with a subsequent action in <see cref="P:Android.Service.Controls.Actions.ControlAction.ChallengeValue" />.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://github.com/aosp-mirror/platform_frameworks_base/blob/1cdfff555f4a21f71ccc978290e2e212e2f8b168/core/java/android/service/controls/actions/ControlAction.java">Android response constants and authentication challenge contract.</a></format></para>
